      "widgets_values": [
        "<Picture 1> is the authoritative appearance and identity reference for the single subject, and shows the opening composition. <Picture 2> shows the desired ending pose and composition of that same subject. Keep the subject recognizably the same person throughout: the same facial structure, eyes, nose, mouth, hair, skin texture and body proportions. Keep the outfit, lighting and setting consistent with the endpoint images.\n\nOne continuous shot. The subject makes a small, natural movement from the opening pose to the ending pose, with subtle breathing and blinking. The face remains clearly visible. The camera is steady. Preserve natural photographic detail and coherent motion. No cuts, morphing, face replacement or sudden changes in appearance. Natural ambient sound; no dialogue or music.",
